# Octo — frontend development

- **Packages:** `packages/ui` (`@octo/ui`) — shell-agnostic React; `packages/agent-client` — bridge types and client.
- **Apps:** `apps/desktop` — Tauri 2 host; `apps/web` — future static host.
- **Isolation:** `packages/ui` must not import `@tauri-apps/*` or call platform APIs. Shell-specific code stays in `apps/desktop`.
- **Agent boundary:** UI talks only to the harness through the `Bridge` interface (`@octo/agent-client`), never directly to the filesystem or a shell.
- **Code rules:** `.cursor/rules/octo-typescript.mdc`. **Architecture:** `packages/ui/ARCHITECTURE.md`. **Per-module instructions:** `packages/ui/AGENTS.md`, `packages/agent-client/AGENTS.md`, `apps/desktop/AGENTS.md`.
- **Before finishing frontend changes** (repo root):

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm --filter @octo/agent-client test
pnpm --filter @octo/ui lint
pnpm --filter @octo/desktop build
cd apps/desktop/src-tauri && cargo check
```

- **Bridge URL:** `VITE_HARNESS_BRIDGE_URL` / `HARNESS_BRIDGE_URL`; default `http://127.0.0.1:8790`.
